text_frame=choose("Ah! A customer still breathing. That is always good for business.","Supplies are not cheap these days… but they might keep you alive.","Potions, charms, and remedies. Take what you need.","Gems first, questions later.","If it is on the shelf, it is for sale. Do not ask where it came from.","Looking to stock up?")

